id, that didn't go well.\r\n\r\nIn the end, DC is still the same mess. They can't properly build a plot and create a movie that sustains its own beliefs. Ben Affleck's Batman, at the start, said we can't change our past due to the fact that those key moments that leave scars are the moments that build our foundation and make us who we are. It seems that Barry Allen didn't learn shit from this two-hour journey.	tmdb	\N	2026-02-04 15:44:54.887216+00	\N	Differ	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kZmuQ5xPAQZnytabUwcohjl3Mp7.jpg	0
