c3ce3da6-d055-452a-9fc4-c80d261e9627	de286ae5-e758-4e92-a3ba-551cbe841330	Elyas is master class in how to make a frenetic, engaging military action flick. \r\n\r\nThis film is wall to wall action that not only does not stop it gets better and better, as the film progresses. It even manages to have a decent, if familiar, back story to tie things together. \r\n\r\nIn summary, its been a long time since I have enjoyed a military style  action film this much. A must watch for those of us who enjoy this genre.	tmdb	8	2026-02-04 15:47:41.659396+00	\N	MovieGuys	\N	0
